      "notes": "Scan performance: O(D × N) propagateMetadata replaced with single-pass depth-stack (5.14M-entry trees went from 16-20 min hang to 2m 24s). Plus six API additions in c4: c4m.PropagateMetadata exported, c4m.WriteCanonical, scan.WithProgress, scan.WithMaxConcurrency, scan.WithContext, scan.WithEntryStream; progressive scanner propagation wired."
